  "display_title": "Kiss and Slither",
  "description": "When Han Sorang was hired as a model for a photoshoot, he didn’t realize just how…authentic the director would want it to be. As if being brought to a dusty old palace and forced into women’s clothing isn’t enough, Sorang’s day gets even stranger when a charm appears out of nowhere and sends him into a deep slumber. When he awakes, he thinks he is totally alone, until a man - no, a beast! - appears, declaring them spouses. Things are moving way too fast for Sorang, especially when the creature reveals himself to be gifted with an extra member. Two heads may be better than one, but three is far, far too many! \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
